{
  "contract": "search-rows",
  "version": 1,
  "about": [
    "The shared definition of a search result and the order results are owed,",
    "for Mac, iOS, and web (meet#174). One row model, one kind table, one door",
    "grammar, one matcher. The bug this table exists to prevent is each surface",
    "keeping its own search: a Work field that matches on one rule, a Team field",
    "on another, a palette on a third, and a person who types the same word in",
    "two places and gets two answers.",
    "Every search field is the palette's query with a fixed scope (decision 12):",
    "the palette asks with every kind, a per-surface field with its own kinds.",
    "Swift: Sources/Search.swift. TypeScript: packages/contracts/src/search.ts."
  ],
  "rules": [
    "KINDS: the sixteen below, in this order, and this order is the kind order",
    "used to break ties. The first thirteen are hits (things); the last three are",
    "doors (places and verbs). A hit's `door` opens the thing; a door's `door`",
    "is the place or verb itself.",
    "DOOR: a string in the grammar `<to>:<id>` — `destination:<name>`,",
    "`settings:<page>`, `verb:<name>`, `subject:<subjectKind>:<id>`, and",
    "`person|agent|contact|thread|document|folder|event|task|issue|core:<id>`. A door names",
    "an existing route or window destination; the palette never invents",
    "navigation. A door that does not parse is not a row.",
    "SCOPE: the set of kinds a field asks for. A row outside the scope is not",
    "considered. The palette's scope is every kind; Work is subject, contact,",
    "task, issue, core, document; Team is person, agent, thread; Calendar is event;",
    "Docs is document and folder. Which rows a field is given (which library, which",
    "store) is the field's own concern; the matcher takes rows as it is handed",
    "them.",
    "NORMALIZE: query and text compare case-folded and diacritic-folded; a",
    "word is a run of letters or digits. The query's tokens are its words; an",
    "empty query has no tokens.",
    "MATCH: every token must match the row. A token matches at tier 2 when a",
    "word in the title starts with it, at tier 1 when the title contains it,",
    "at tier 0 when the subtitle contains it, and not at all otherwise. The",
    "row's tier is the lowest tier among its tokens. An empty query matches",
    "every row in scope at tier 2.",
    "ORDER `list` (decision 13): the matches, in the order the rows were",
    "given. A field over an in-place list (Work rail, Team list, Calendar)",
    "thins the list; it does not reshuffle it.",
    "ORDER `rank` (decision 10): higher tier first; then a row whose key is in",
    "`recents` before one that is not, earlier in `recents` first; then kind",
    "order; then the order the rows were given. A key is `<kind>:<id>`.",
    "RECENTS: the keys of the last opened hits, newest first, kept per device",
    "and never on the server. A key that names no row is ignored. Only hits",
    "are recents; a door in `recents` is ignored.",
    "PERSON VERBS: a person is one row. Its verbs are Message, Wave, Call, in",
    "that order, named per docs/SURFACES.md; a client drops Call when the",
    "person is not callable. An agent's only verb is Message. Knock is a",
    "guest's gesture at a room door and is not a person verb. Never four rows",
    "per person.",
    "SUBJECT VERBS: a subject is one row too. Its verbs are New task, New",
    "issue, New document, Start room about this, in that order, for a project",
    "or a lead; New task alone for an event or a partner. The names are the bare palette verbs' with the subject as the",
    "argument; the row's door stays `subject:<kind>:<id>`, the verb travels",
    "beside it. A client that cannot start a room drops Start room.",
    "IMAGE: an optional URL of a mark for the row — an organization's logo on",
    "a subject; absent otherwise. Never matched, never ranked. A client draws",
    "the kind's glyph when it is absent or fails to load; a person's face comes",
    "from the roster by the row's id, never from this field."
  ],
  "kinds": ["subject", "person", "agent", "contact", "thread", "document", "folder", "event", "task", "issue", "goal", "decision", "milestone", "call", "core", "destination", "settings", "verb"],
  "hitKinds": ["subject", "person", "agent", "contact", "thread", "document", "folder", "event", "task", "issue", "goal", "decision", "milestone", "call", "core"],
  "doorKinds": ["destination", "settings", "verb"],
  "destinations": ["home", "calendar", "work", "team", "docs"],
  "settingsPages": ["account", "home", "work", "calendar", "appearance", "about"],
  "verbs": ["new-task", "new-issue", "new-document", "start-room", "open-internal-room"],
  "personVerbs": {"person": ["message", "wave", "call"], "agent": ["message"]},
  "subjectVerbs": {"project": ["new-task", "new-issue", "new-document", "start-room"], "lead": ["new-task", "new-issue", "new-document", "start-room"], "event": ["new-task"], "organization": ["new-task"]},
  "scopes": {
    "palette": ["subject", "person", "agent", "contact", "thread", "document", "folder", "event", "task", "issue", "goal", "decision", "milestone", "call", "core", "destination", "settings", "verb"],
    "work": ["subject", "contact", "task", "issue", "goal", "decision", "milestone", "call", "core", "document"],
    "team": ["person", "agent", "thread"],
    "calendar": ["event"],
    "docs": ["document", "folder"]
  },
  "doors": [
    {"door": "destination:calendar", "parsed": {"to": "destination", "destination": "calendar"}},
    {"door": "settings:home", "parsed": {"to": "settings", "page": "home"}},
    {"door": "verb:new-task", "parsed": {"to": "verb", "verb": "new-task"}},
    {"door": "subject:project:acme", "parsed": {"to": "subject", "subjectKind": "project", "id": "acme"}},
    {"door": "subject:lead:globex-2026", "parsed": {"to": "subject", "subjectKind": "lead", "id": "globex-2026"}},
    {"door": "person:nadia@example.com", "parsed": {"to": "person", "id": "nadia@example.com"}},
    {"door": "agent:scout", "parsed": {"to": "agent", "id": "scout"}},
    {"door": "contact:c_17", "parsed": {"to": "contact", "id": "c_17"}},
    {"door": "thread:dm:nadia", "parsed": {"to": "thread", "id": "dm:nadia"}},
    {"door": "document:doc_42", "parsed": {"to": "document", "id": "doc_42"}},
    {"door": "folder:folder_42", "parsed": {"to": "folder", "id": "folder_42"}},
    {"door": "event:google:abc/def", "parsed": {"to": "event", "id": "google:abc/def"}},
    {"door": "task:task_7", "parsed": {"to": "task", "id": "task_7"}},
    {"door": "issue:envisioning/starlings#174", "parsed": {"to": "issue", "id": "envisioning/starlings#174"}},
    {"door": "core:core_9", "parsed": {"to": "core", "id": "core_9"}}
  ],
  "badDoors": ["", "calendar", "destination:", "destination:mars", "settings:general", "verb:teleport", "subject:acme", "subject:partner:", "subject:client:acme", "person:", "room:team"],
  "rows": [
    {"kind": "destination", "id": "home", "title": "Home", "subtitle": "", "door": "destination:home"},
    {"kind": "destination", "id": "calendar", "title": "Calendar", "subtitle": "", "door": "destination:calendar"},
    {"kind": "destination", "id": "work", "title": "Work", "subtitle": "", "door": "destination:work"},
    {"kind": "destination", "id": "team", "title": "Team", "subtitle": "", "door": "destination:team"},
    {"kind": "destination", "id": "docs", "title": "Docs", "subtitle": "", "door": "destination:docs"},
    {"kind": "settings", "id": "account", "title": "Account", "subtitle": "Settings", "door": "settings:account"},
    {"kind": "settings", "id": "home", "title": "Home", "subtitle": "Settings", "door": "settings:home"},
    {"kind": "settings", "id": "work", "title": "Work", "subtitle": "Settings", "door": "settings:work"},
    {"kind": "settings", "id": "calendar", "title": "Calendar", "subtitle": "Settings", "door": "settings:calendar"},
    {"kind": "verb", "id": "new-task", "title": "New task", "subtitle": "", "door": "verb:new-task"},
    {"kind": "verb", "id": "new-issue", "title": "New issue", "subtitle": "", "door": "verb:new-issue"},
    {"kind": "verb", "id": "new-document", "title": "New document", "subtitle": "", "door": "verb:new-document"},
    {"kind": "verb", "id": "start-room", "title": "Start room", "subtitle": "", "door": "verb:start-room"},
    {"kind": "verb", "id": "open-internal-room", "title": "Open the internal room", "subtitle": "", "door": "verb:open-internal-room"},
    {"kind": "subject", "id": "acme", "title": "Acme Corp", "subtitle": "Project", "door": "subject:project:acme"},
    {"kind": "subject", "id": "globex-2026", "title": "Globex", "subtitle": "Lead", "door": "subject:lead:globex-2026"},
    {"kind": "person", "id": "nadia@example.com", "title": "Nadia Silva", "subtitle": "Design", "door": "person:nadia@example.com"},
    {"kind": "person", "id": "ines@example.com", "title": "Inês Martins", "subtitle": "Engineering", "door": "person:ines@example.com"},
    {"kind": "agent", "id": "scout", "title": "Scout", "subtitle": "Agent", "door": "agent:scout"},
    {"kind": "contact", "id": "c_17", "title": "Hana Okafor", "subtitle": "Buyer · Initech · hana@initech.example", "door": "contact:c_17"},
    {"kind": "thread", "id": "dm:nadia", "title": "Nadia Silva", "subtitle": "Direct message", "door": "thread:dm:nadia"},
    {"kind": "document", "id": "doc_42", "title": "Acme kickoff notes", "subtitle": "Meetings", "door": "document:doc_42"},
    {"kind": "document", "id": "doc_43", "title": "Calendar planning", "subtitle": "Envisioning", "door": "document:doc_43"},
    {"kind": "folder", "id": "folder_42", "title": "Folder 42", "subtitle": "Docs", "door": "folder:folder_42"},
    {"kind": "event", "id": "google:abc/def", "title": "Acme weekly", "subtitle": "Tue 14:00", "door": "event:google:abc/def"},
    {"kind": "task", "id": "task_7", "title": "Send Acme the proposal", "subtitle": "Acme Corp", "door": "task:task_7"},
    {"kind": "issue", "id": "envisioning/starlings#174", "title": "Search: one ⌘K palette", "subtitle": "envisioning/starlings", "door": "issue:envisioning/starlings#174"},
    {"kind": "core", "id": "core_9", "title": "Nadia Silva", "subtitle": "Contact · Acme Corp", "door": "core:core_9"}
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "an empty query in the palette is recents, then hits, then doors, in kind order",
      "query": "",
      "scope": "palette",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": ["document:doc_42", "person:nadia@example.com"],
      "expect": ["document:doc_42", "person:nadia@example.com", "subject:acme", "subject:globex-2026", "person:ines@example.com", "agent:scout", "contact:c_17", "thread:dm:nadia", "document:doc_43", "folder:folder_42", "event:google:abc/def", "task:task_7", "issue:envisioning/starlings#174", "core:core_9", "destination:home", "destination:calendar", "destination:work", "destination:team", "destination:docs", "settings:account", "settings:home", "settings:work", "settings:calendar", "verb:new-task", "verb:new-issue", "verb:new-document", "verb:start-room", "verb:open-internal-room"]
    },
    {
      "name": "a recent that names no row, and a door in recents, are ignored",
      "query": "",
      "scope": "docs",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": ["document:doc_99", "destination:docs", "document:doc_43"],
      "expect": ["document:doc_43", "document:doc_42", "folder:folder_42"]
    },
    {
      "name": "a word prefix in the title beats a substring, which beats the subtitle",
      "query": "ac",
      "scope": "palette",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": [],
      "expect": ["subject:acme", "document:doc_42", "event:google:abc/def", "task:task_7", "settings:account", "core:core_9"]
    },
    {
      "name": "a person is one row, once, and their thread and Core contact are their own kinds",
      "query": "nadia",
      "scope": "palette",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": [],
      "expect": ["person:nadia@example.com", "thread:dm:nadia", "core:core_9"]
    },
    {
      "name": "recently opened beats never opened inside a tier",
      "query": "acme",
      "scope": "palette",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": ["task:task_7"],
      "expect": ["task:task_7", "subject:acme", "document:doc_42", "event:google:abc/def", "core:core_9"]
    },
    {
      "name": "recently opened does not beat a higher tier",
      "query": "acme",
      "scope": "palette",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": ["core:core_9"],
      "expect": ["subject:acme", "document:doc_42", "event:google:abc/def", "task:task_7", "core:core_9"]
    },
    {
      "name": "case and diacritics do not matter",
      "query": "INES",
      "scope": "team",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": [],
      "expect": ["person:ines@example.com"]
    },
    {
      "name": "every token must match",
      "query": "acme notes",
      "scope": "palette",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": [],
      "expect": ["document:doc_42"]
    },
    {
      "name": "every token must match, and the row's tier is its weakest token",
      "query": "acme corp",
      "scope": "palette",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": [],
      "expect": ["subject:acme", "task:task_7", "core:core_9"]
    },
    {
      "name": "a token can match the subtitle when the title has it not",
      "query": "engineering",
      "scope": "palette",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": [],
      "expect": ["person:ines@example.com"]
    },
    {
      "name": "scope hides what is outside it, whatever the query",
      "query": "home",
      "scope": "work",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": [],
      "expect": []
    },
    {
      "name": "a scoped field over a list keeps the list's order",
      "query": "a",
      "scope": "work",
      "order": "list",
      "recents": ["core:core_9"],
      "expect": ["subject:acme", "subject:globex-2026", "contact:c_17", "document:doc_42", "document:doc_43", "task:task_7", "issue:envisioning/starlings#174", "core:core_9"]
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty query over a list is the list",
      "query": "  ",
      "scope": "team",
      "order": "list",
      "recents": ["agent:scout"],
      "expect": ["person:nadia@example.com", "person:ines@example.com", "agent:scout", "thread:dm:nadia"]
    },
    {
      "name": "whitespace around and between tokens is nothing",
      "query": "  send   acme ",
      "scope": "palette",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": [],
      "expect": ["task:task_7"]
    },
    {
      "name": "a contact is found by its organization and its address, in Work",
      "query": "initech",
      "scope": "work",
      "order": "list",
      "recents": [],
      "expect": ["contact:c_17"]
    },
    {
      "name": "nothing matches nothing",
      "query": "zzz",
      "scope": "palette",
      "order": "rank",
      "recents": [],
      "expect": []
    }
  ]
}
